<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Now the Lord is the living air;</l><l>You can breathe Him in anywhere—</l><l>Anytime of day, whenever you please.</l><l>He’s made it really easy.</l><l>O Lord! Amen!</l><l>Let’s sing it again.</l></lg>
<lg label="3."><l>Now the Lord lives inside of me.</l><l>And He’s filling me constantly.</l><l>Yes, He’s filling up every gap.</l><l>He makes me really happy.</l><l>I’m so happy!</l><l>Hallelujah! Taste and see!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
